  "description": "Follow police officers HAIA and RHEIN as they protect the city Labihem from crime in the year 2045. HAIA, a lonely being who was always alone, and RHEIN, who had to see his father's death.. The two start to grow feelings for each other as they get closer.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1020007625), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/57384722), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/polis), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/laviehem_police), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H040357560), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H040357560), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230392)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/-/en/dp/B0BT1SY544/)",
